Z||000000||FIERO1985||03-14-2001||03:00 PM||||My 85 gt 4 speed Has begun a problem I hope it is small when I start the car up in the morning and let it run it does fine warming up but when I drive 4-5 miles or more then stop and put in nuetral the car will bog down on the tach and if I dont give it any help by gasing it, it will die but start up fine right after it dies but like I said if I help it, it will cough and hesitate 10-15 seconds and jump up again. Also I dont know if this is another subject but when driving at a constant speed then letting off gas it will ping and pop even backfire pretty loud,but only when under acceleration then letting off or like in 3 or 4th gear letting off the gas.<P> I always use:<BR>Shell Gasoline (87 octane)<BR>I just did a minor tune up (rapidfire plugs, Wires, cap and rotor.)<BR>I have done plenty other repairs<P>I thought possably ignition timing <P>Please give me any poss. to check <BR>So I can tell you If I have done it or replaced it<P><BR>Thanks you all who can help!!<P>Dan<BR>85 gt 4speed<P>------------------<BR>1985 GT V6 <BR>"LETS RACE"||||reg||4
